WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.393 --> 00:00:03.883
Unit twenty-two. Creative Commons and Copyright!

2
00:00:04.903 --> 00:00:09.424
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.474 --> 00:00:13.012
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.062 --> 00:00:17.526
Today we learn about Creative Commons and Copyright. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.459 --> 00:00:22.383
Copyright. Say it with me. Copyright!

6
00:00:25.855 --> 00:00:30.080
Creative Commons. Say it with me. Creative Commons!

7
00:00:33.614 --> 00:00:37.381
License. Say it with me. License!

8
00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:45.024
Attribution. Say it with me. Attribution!

9
00:00:48.531 --> 00:00:52.064
Permission. Say it with me. Permission!

10
00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:59.994
Public domain. Say it with me. Public domain!

11
00:01:03.518 --> 00:01:06.849
Credit. Say it with me. Credit!

12
00:01:10.353 --> 00:01:14.002
Use. Say it with me. Use!

13
00:01:17.433 --> 00:01:29.436
Copyright protects creative work. A Creative Commons license can give permission to use work if you give attribution. Public domain work is free to use, but giving credit is still good practice.

14
00:01:29.486 --> 00:01:32.869
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:39.316
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:40.516
License!

17
00:01:41.673 --> 00:01:46.871
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.921 --> 00:01:48.071
Credit!

19
00:01:48.877 --> 00:01:54.068
Did you know? Creative Commons licences were first released in 2002!

20
00:01:54.118 --> 00:01:56.639
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:57.853 --> 00:02:06.260
Think and answer. How can you find images you are allowed to use?

22
00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:07.460
Great answer!

23
00:02:08.758 --> 00:02:13.750
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.864
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

